  "_note": "Baseline metrics snapshot the playtest skill diffs against (§13.2, #140). It is a snapshot of the --bot batch below on the commit named, now one block PER PLAYSTYLE PROFILE (#198): a profile is a temperament, so each has its own numbers and they are never compared against each other as a leaderboard. It is SUPPOSED to drift: after any change expected to move the numbers (a tuning [START] knob, guard/vision/ability behaviour, generation, the bot policy itself, a profile's numbers), refresh every block with the commands below and commit the new snapshot in the same PR. A stale baseline compared silently is the anti-pattern this file exists to avoid.",
